Host bastion-lab
    HostName BASTION_PUBLIC_IP
    User ec2-user
    IdentityFile ~/Downloads/clave-lab-bastion.pem
    IdentitiesOnly yes

Host private-server
    HostName 10.10.2.107
    User ec2-user
    IdentityFile ~/Downloads/clave-lab-bastion.pem
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    ProxyJump bastion-lab